{
  "cases": [
    {
      "case_id": "G10",
      "operator": "Quadric ONNX Runtime CPU int8 QLinearConvTranspose",
      "roles": [
        "输出元素 y[0,c,h,w]",
        "第 7 槽的标量输出零点 y_zero_point",
        "卷积 int32 累加值",
        "重定标及写回消费者 MlasRequantizeOutput"
      ],
      "actions": [
        {
          "id": "G10-requantize-output",
          "description": "在固定旧版的 CPU 输出重定标调用中，向 MlasRequantizeOutput 的 ZeroPoint 形参传入 (T)0。对指定单批单组模型，x_zero_point 和 w_zero_point 均为 0，y_zero_point 为 25 或 -30 时，每个输出元素所需的输出零点加项被遗漏，满足 C2。y_zero_point 为 0 时，实参与该加项一致。",
          "role": "primary",
          "upstream_id": null,
          "scope": {
            "source_id": "s6",
            "claim": "static",
            "build": null,
            "call_id": null
          },
          "facts": [
            {
              "key": "applicable_contract",
              "value": true,
              "claim_state": "derived",
              "explanation": "第 6、7 槽定义输出张量的逐张量量化比例和零点。旧调用把卷积累加缓冲交给 MlasRequantizeOutput，由它重定标并写入 Ydata，因此该调用承担每个输出元素的输出量化。",
              "anchors": [
                {"source_id": "s4", "start_line": 1, "end_line": 10, "use": "requirement"},
                {"source_id": "s6", "start_line": 11, "end_line": 22, "use": "behavior"}
              ]
            },
            {
              "key": "required_member",
              "value": true,
              "claim_state": "derived",
              "explanation": "对每个输出元素，约定结果为 sat_int8(round(acc × (x_scale × w_scale / y_scale)) + y_zero_point)。同一个第 7 槽标量对各输出元素分别承担输出编码偏移的角色，每个目标元素须计入一次。旧调用的 ZeroPoint 实参就是承载此加项的位置。",
              "anchors": [
                {"source_id": "s4", "start_line": 1, "end_line": 10, "use": "requirement"},
                {"source_id": "s5", "start_line": 15, "end_line": 19, "use": "behavior"},
                {"source_id": "s6", "start_line": 11, "end_line": 22, "use": "behavior"},
                {"source_id": "s7", "start_line": 11, "end_line": 14, "use": "behavior"},
                {"source_id": "s8", "start_line": 5, "end_line": 11, "use": "behavior"}
              ]
            },
            {
              "key": "omitted_contribution",
              "value": true,
              "claim_state": "derived",
              "explanation": "固定模型没有可选卷积偏置。旧调用的 MLAS Bias 实参为 nullptr，Scale 仅由量化比例组成，ZeroPoint 实参恒为 0。所示 SSE2 消费路径以该 0 形成裁剪界限和加法向量，缩放、取整后加零，随后打包写出。写回后调用方只推进指针并返回。该输出重定标及写回链中，约定的 +25 或 -30 实际计入零次，所示路径没有等价补偿。",
              "anchors": [
                {"source_id": "s4", "start_line": 6, "end_line": 17, "use": "requirement"},
                {"source_id": "s5", "start_line": 15, "end_line": 19, "use": "behavior"},
                {"source_id": "s6", "start_line": 5, "end_line": 27, "use": "behavior"},
                {"source_id": "s7", "start_line": 21, "end_line": 24, "use": "behavior"},
                {"source_id": "s8", "start_line": 5, "end_line": 16, "use": "behavior"},
                {"source_id": "s8", "start_line": 25, "end_line": 36, "use": "behavior"}
              ]
            },
            {
              "key": "implementation_action",
              "value": true,
              "claim_state": "derived",
              "explanation": "CPU 旧文件 qlinearconvtranspose.cc 在把输出累加缓冲重定标到 Ydata 时，将 MlasRequantizeOutput 第八个实参固定为 (T)0。对第 7 输入槽给出非零 int8 输出零点的模型，这个实参转发动作以中性值代替了必需加项。",
              "anchors": [
                {"source_id": "s4", "start_line": 6, "end_line": 10, "use": "requirement"},
                {"source_id": "s6", "start_line": 11, "end_line": 18, "use": "behavior"},
                {"source_id": "s7", "start_line": 6, "end_line": 14, "use": "behavior"}
              ]
            },
            {
              "key": "causal_role",
              "value": true,
              "claim_state": "derived",
              "explanation": "在可追溯的旧路径中，调用点将输出零点固定为零，直接决定了下游加法的操作数。消费端按收到的零点裁剪和加法。调用点若传入约定值，所示消费路径即会在写回前使用它。根动作计为该实参转发一次。",
              "anchors": [
                {"source_id": "s4", "start_line": 6, "end_line": 10, "use": "requirement"},
                {"source_id": "s6", "start_line": 11, "end_line": 22, "use": "behavior"},
                {"source_id": "s7", "start_line": 21, "end_line": 24, "use": "behavior"},
                {"source_id": "s8", "start_line": 7, "end_line": 11, "use": "behavior"}
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "readback": "静态结论绑定 fac7b31168cc88790d7c8a2be07692ade3a354bf，限于单批单组、无可选偏置、输入和权重零点均为 0 的固定模型。Issue 的 s1 第 10 至 32 行给出模型，s2 第 2、9 至 10 行显示三种输出零点下 ORT 的 147 个输出元素完全相同，s3 第 3 至 5 行给出 SDK 26.08、ORT 1.20.0 和 CPUExecutionProvider。这些报告材料是背景。当前缺少将该次调用绑定到固定提交及所示 SSE2 分支的构建和调用记录。"
    }
  ]
}
